    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling first-person game, full of puzzles that will captivate you from the very beginning, set in the streets of Spain's capital, Madrid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are \u00c1lex, and you have a clear mission: to find the legendary Gold of Retiro, hidden since the 18th century by Cirilo, a mysterious figure wandering through Plaza Mayor, seeking someone to free him from his curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the clues left by your grandfather and with Cirilo's help, you must venture into hidden tunnels, solve historical riddles, and evade the Guardians of the Treasure, who will do everything to stop you. The paths to the treasure are sealed, and the modern city hides secrets that have remained hidden for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the mysteries of Madrid and find the lost treasure?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling first-person game, full of puzzles that will captivate you from the very beginning, set in the streets of Spain's capital, Madrid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are \u00c1lex, and you have a clear mission: to find the legendary Gold of Retiro, hidden since the 18th century by Cirilo, a mysterious figure wandering through Plaza Mayor, seeking someone to free him from his curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the clues left by your grandfather and with Cirilo's help, you must venture into hidden tunnels, solve historical riddles, and evade the Guardians of the Treasure, who will do everything to stop you. The paths to the treasure are sealed, and the modern city hides secrets that have remained hidden for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the mysteries of Madrid and find the lost treasure?</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an epic 3D adventure through Madrid, where you take on the role of a detective searching for your grandfather. Explore the city's streets, uncovering mysteries and confronting legendary tales.",
